1 NOTE Auqui Huallpa Tupec Yupanqui was forced to become a "puppet emperor" of Francisco Pizarro Gonzalez.
2 CONT It was all preplanned to fool the Inca people that they were still being ruled by an Inca when in fact Pizarro had usurped the throne from the true heads of state. One can see a negative cycle of premeditated Regicide being commit
2 CONC ted by the Spanish governors that began with the trumped up charges of criminality that led to the death of Atahualpa Inca Yupanqui.
2 CONT Auqui Huallpa Tupec Yupanqui died unexpectedly at Jauja. Poisoning was surpected.
